'''Junari Point''' was a seaside location that was located several [[kilometer]]s away from the [[Chandrilan]] [[capital]] of [[Hanna City]]. It was home to a [[Unidentified bar (Junari Point)|bar]] that was frequented by the former [[Imperial Security Bureau]] [[loyalty officer]] [[Sinjir Rath Velus]] during his rest and recreation [[time]].<ref name="Life Debt" />

